  "purpose" : "(Clinical Focus: This set of values represent Programs for all domains as selected by the Gravity Project.),(Data Element Scope: In the FHIR HealthcareService resource, these values may be used for HealthcareService.Program and in the Observation resource, these values may be used for Observation.Code. These values serve as the reference for programs in Gravity Project data standard-aligned efforts.),(Inclusion Criteria: Includes children of SNOMED CT Services (SCT ID 224930009) for all domains as selected by the Gravity Project.),(Exclusion Criteria: Excludes the SNOMED CT Services not selected by the Gravity Project.)",
